---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { catalog } from '../data/catalog';
import { imageUrl, sourceImageUrl } from '../domain/chroma';
import { localizedPath, resolveLocale, type Locale } from '../i18n/config';
import { CHINA_EXCLUSIVE_DEFINITION } from '../seo/site';
import { SITE } from '../seo/site';

interface Props { locale?: Locale }
const locale = Astro.props.locale ?? resolveLocale(Astro.currentLocale);
const isZh = locale === 'zh-cn';

const firstChroma = catalog.reduce((lowest, item) => item.rank < lowest.rank ? item : lowest);
const jadeSwordChroma = catalog.find((item) => item.nameZh === '玉剑传说 无极 白虎');

const title = isZh ? '什么是《英雄联盟》中国服炫彩原画？ | LoL Chroma Art' : 'What Are Chroma Splash Arts? | LoL Chroma Art';
const description = isZh ? '了解腾讯运营的《英雄联盟》中国版本为特定炫彩提供的独立炫彩原画。' : 'Learn about unique splash arts created for selected chromas in the Chinese version of League of Legends, operated by Tencent.';
const canonical = new URL(localizedPath(locale, '/about/'), SITE.origin).toString();
const jsonLd = { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'AboutPage', name: title, description, url: canonical, inLanguage: isZh ? 'zh-CN' : 'en' };
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} {canonical} {jsonLd} {locale}>
  {!isZh && <article class="about-page">
    <p class="kicker">ABOUT THE ARCHIVE</p>
    <h1>What Are Chroma Splash Arts in League of Legends?</h1>
    <p>A chroma splash art is a unique splash artwork created for a specific chroma. Most chromas reuse their base skin's splash art and do not have one of their own.</p>
    <figure class="about-art">
      <img src={imageUrl(firstChroma.images.large)} data-fallback={sourceImageUrl('large', firstChroma.instanceId)} data-placeholder="/placeholder.svg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
    </figure>

    <section>
      <h2>Chroma Splash Arts in the Chinese Version</h2>
      <p>{CHINA_EXCLUSIVE_DEFINITION.en}</p>
      <p>Selected chromas in the Chinese version of League of Legends, operated by Tencent, are presented with their own splash arts. Availability and release timing vary by event and patch.</p>
      {jadeSwordChroma && <figure class="about-art">
        <img src={imageUrl(jadeSwordChroma.images.large)} data-fallback={sourceImageUrl('large', jadeSwordChroma.instanceId)} data-placeholder="/placeholder.svg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>}
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Availability and Release Tracking</h2>
      <p>LoL Chroma Art records the patch associated with each catalog entry and adds new chroma splash arts when verified source data becomes available. For current purchase requirements, players should consult the active Chinese server event or store information.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Prestige Chroma and Other Categories</h2>
      <p>LoL Chroma Art uses Prestige Chroma as the English label for the Chinese 臻彩 category. A Prestige Chroma is still a chroma of an existing skin, not a traditional Prestige Skin. The archive may also include chroma splash arts from other categories, and focuses on identifying each chroma, its base skin, patch, category, and unique artwork.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-section">
      <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>Have questions, suggestions, or just want to say hi? Feel free to reach out.</p>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li>
          <svg class="contact-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M.05 3.555A2 2 0 0 1 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 1 1.95 1.555L8 8.414zM2 1v1.145l5.803 3.546.197-.14.197.14L14 2.145V1zm13.8 2.698L8 9.586 2.2 3.698l-.15.158V12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V3.856z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          <span class="contact-label">Email</span>
          <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:lolchromaart@outlook.com">lolchromaart@outlook.com</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg class="contact-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.6.75h2.454l-5.36 6.142L16 15.25h-4.937l-3.867-5.07-4.425 5.07H.316l5.733-6.57L0 .75h5.063l3.495 4.633L12.601.75Zm-.86 13.028h1.36L4.323 2.145H2.865z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          <span class="contact-label">X (Twitter)</span>
          <a class="contact-link" href="https://x.com/BreadJ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@BreadJ</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>}

  {isZh && <article class="about-page">
    <p class="kicker">关于图鉴</p>
    <h1>什么是《英雄联盟》中国服炫彩原画？</h1>
    <p>炫彩原画是为特定炫彩单独创作的原画；炫彩并不天然拥有独立原画。本站收录的是国服臻彩及其专属原画。</p>
    <figure class="about-art">
      <img src={imageUrl(firstChroma.images.large)} data-fallback={sourceImageUrl('large', firstChroma.instanceId)} data-placeholder="/placeholder.svg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
    </figure>

    <section>
      <h2>中国版本中的炫彩原画</h2>
      <p>{CHINA_EXCLUSIVE_DEFINITION.zh}</p>
      <p>由腾讯运营的《英雄联盟》中国版本会为部分特定炫彩提供独立原画；具体上线时间和获取方式会随活动与版本变化。</p>
      {jadeSwordChroma && <figure class="about-art">
        <img src={imageUrl(jadeSwordChroma.images.large)} data-fallback={sourceImageUrl('large', jadeSwordChroma.instanceId)} data-placeholder="/placeholder.svg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </figure>}
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>上架与更新追踪</h2>
      <p>LoL Chroma Art 记录每件藏品对应的游戏版本，并在获得可靠数据后更新图鉴；当前获取条件应以中国服务器正在进行的活动或商城信息为准。</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>臻彩与其他分类</h2>
      <p>本站将"臻彩"分类译作 Prestige Chroma。臻彩仍是现有皮肤的炫彩，并非传统至臻皮肤；本站也可能收录其他分类的炫彩原画，重点记录炫彩名称、基础皮肤、版本、分类和独立原画。</p>
    </section>
  
    <section class="contact-section">
      <h2>联系我们</h2>
      <p>有任何问题、建议或合作意向，欢迎通过以下方式联系。</p>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li>
          <svg class="contact-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M.05 3.555A2 2 0 0 1 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 1 1.95 1.555L8 8.414zM2 1v1.145l5.803 3.546.197-.14.197.14L14 2.145V1zm13.8 2.698L8 9.586 2.2 3.698l-.15.158V12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V3.856z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          <span class="contact-label">邮箱</span>
          <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:lolchromaart@outlook.com">lolchromaart@outlook.com</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg class="contact-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.6.75h2.454l-5.36 6.142L16 15.25h-4.937l-3.867-5.07-4.425 5.07H.316l5.733-6.57L0 .75h5.063l3.495 4.633L12.601.75Zm-.86 13.028h1.36L4.323 2.145H2.865z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          <span class="contact-label">X (Twitter)</span>
          <a class="contact-link" href="https://x.com/BreadJ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@BreadJ</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>}

  <style>
    .about-page { width: min(860px, calc(100% - (var(--page-gutter) * 2))); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 120px) 0 100px; }
    .about-page h1 { font-family: Georgia, "Noto Serif SC", serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); line-height: 1.08; margin: .45em 0 .6em; font-weight: 500; }
    .about-page section { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 42px; padding-top: 34px; }
    .about-page h2 { font-family: Georgia, "Noto Serif SC", serif; color: var(--gold); font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .about-page p:not(.kicker) { color: #c7cad4; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0; }
    .about-page section p + p { margin-top: 1em; }
    .about-art { width: 100%; margin: 32px 0 0; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #090b15; box-shadow: 0 18px 48px #0008; }
    .about-art img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; }
    .contact-section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .contact-list { list-style: none; margin: 20px 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
    .contact-list li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px 18px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; transition: border-color .2s ease; }
    @media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){ .contact-list li:hover { border-color: #8b744b; } }
    .contact-icon { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex: none; color: var(--gold); }
    .contact-label { color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .04em; min-width: 90px; flex: none; }
    .contact-link { color: var(--gold); font-size: .95rem; word-break: break-all; transition: color .15s ease; }
    .contact-link:hover { color: #e8cc8a; }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .about-page { padding: 52px 0 72px; }
      .about-page h1 { font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 10vw, 3rem); }
      .about-page section { margin-top: 34px; padding-top: 28px; }
      .about-page p:not(.kicker) { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; }
      .contact-list li { padding: 12px 14px; gap: 10px; }
      .contact-label { min-width: 72px; font-size: .78rem; }
      .contact-link { font-size: .88rem; }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
